{"id":"vod_sn_38022","vodId":"38022","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"法外制裁者","name_cn":"法外制裁者","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e206be724d996a5429d4371395bcfa05.jpg"},"summary":"在传说中，有一群自称为“CODE BREAKER”的超能力者，在偌大的都市里，他们运用着自己的能力，对那些钻了法律空子的罪人们进行法外的制裁。有人说他们是行侠仗义的正义伙伴，有人说他们是穷凶极恶的暴虐之徒，但真正见过他们身影的人却寥寥无几，有着黑社会背景的大小姐樱小路樱（日笠阳子 配音）正巧就是其中的一员。　　法外制裁者的身份必须绝对保密，于是，对于樱的灭口行动展开了。没想到，樱也是超能力者，并且是能够将所有超能力都无效化的超级稀有品种。于是，樱和这些超能力者的特殊生活开始了。在解决事件的过程中，樱对于正义和法律的信念开始动摇，同时，她的神秘身世慢慢的浮出了水面。此外，她和法外制裁者之一的大神零（冈本信彦 配音）之间也产生了微妙的感情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:57:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fznibim8RL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VqcxT4VV1A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Js0gC2JQvL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jAY9mrSjxb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ljg4Kgt2yw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZJQ1Q7r64D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YdJ7KSx8db1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HSLnnVdp9m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jk3DW0MKuw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UHpgvPhTdH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LisFH1QhwD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZiMa8r5fZT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vnCJULJ8Zz1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:03.767Z"}